<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT sets 1.60 peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>PLDT sets 1.60 peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecommunications firm Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co (PLDT) had set a 1.60 peso cash dividend to common shareholders as of December 19, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on January 15 next year. The ex-dividend date has been set on December 10.</p>
<p>The company had also set a 50 centavo cash dividend to holders of preferred shares series H, L and M as of December 27.</p>
<p>The payment date is on January 31 next year.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
